# Exclude the entire audit dir, not just the file. The dev-machine audit log
# carries dev-side actor strings + filesystem paths that should never ship to
# a public HF Space build. The image carries no audit dir; the first audit
# event creates it, and with research mode on (as the image sets it) that
# event is written on the first visit to the Predict page.
outputs/audit/
outputs/metrics/*.png
outputs/model/__pycache__/
